  "body": "Take the stress out of building with this exceptional house and land package at 11 Kopu Road, offering the perfect blend of coastal lifestyle and modern convenience.\r\n\r\nProperty Highlights:\r\n* Modern Living: This thoughtfully designed home features a spacious open-plan living area that flows seamlessly onto a private deck, perfect for entertaining.  \r\n*  3 Double Bedrooms: Primary bedroom is complete with its own ensuite, alongside two additional well-appointed bedrooms.  \r\n*  2 Bathrooms: A stylish main family bathroom plus the master ensuite.  \r\n*  Gourmet Kitchen: A contemporary kitchen space with an island bench, designed for both functionality and style.  \r\n*  Convenience: A single garage with internal access ensures secure parking and easy entry, whatever the weather.   \r\n*  Design Inspiration: View 3 Kopu Road to see an example of the high-quality finish and contemporary aesthetic you can expect upon completion.   \r\n*  Built by reputable NZ Builder - Westmoreland Residential Ltd with 10 year Stamford Warranty.\r\n\r\nThe Benefits of this House & Land Package:\r\n* Smart Financing: Purchase the land first, with future payments staged and based strictly on build progress. This structure can significantly reduce your interest costs during the construction phase compared to buying a completed new build.\r\n* Lock in Today's Value: Secure your section and building contract now, protecting yourself against future market price increases while your home is being built.\r\n* Brand New Guarantees: Enjoy the peace of mind that comes with a brand-new, low-maintenance home equipped with modern insulation, double glazing, and contemporary fittings.\r\n*  Time to plan: If you're renting or own a home you don't need to rush. After completion, Code Compliance is applied for giving you time to plan the move. Or ask for early occupancy once completed to move in quicker. \r\n\r\nPrime Location & Lifestyle:\r\n* Top School Zones: Perfectly positioned in-zone for the highly regarded Nukumea Primary School and Orewa College.   \r\n* Commuter Friendly: Enjoy incredibly easy access to the Northern Motorway on and off-ramps, making the commute to Auckland or further north a breeze.   \r\n* Coastal Appeal: Nestled in a growing community, just a short distance from the stunning Orewa Beach, local cafes, and shops.   \r\n\r\nDon't miss this opportunity to secure your slice of Orewa. \r\n\r\nContact us today to review the full plans and take the first step toward your brand-new home. Even better, come view a completed home to see the finished product.\r\n\r\n* Photos are of a similar house from the same builder. \r\nDriving instructions - Search Flavell Drive or Mahinga Kai Road, Orewa  and refer to the map in the photos / documents",
